  message: "Updated 2026-04-25 to make the centrality noise-filter co-required (was 'if needed' under Risks/Mitigations). Self-analysis dogfood instrumentation revealed the imports-edge count would jump 2,136 → ~14,149 (6.6×) post-fix, with ~700+ new high-in-degree file Symbols deterministically displacing today's top-ranked classes/functions in centrality output. Mirrors WI-gafog's language-conditional kind='variable' filter precedent. Empirically-confirmed scope and validation steps added; bakeoff revalidation of WI-fozoh's external_symbol count claim flagged as coupled work."  # 2d2d
