  message: "Shipped in PR #3363 (commit 301a80123). All four acceptance criteria met on hypergumbo self-analysis dogfood: (#1) canonical python:<external>:0-0:file:file boundary Symbol drops 1 -> 0; (#1) imports edge count rises 2,136 -> 9,252 with full per-file src attribution restored; (#2) parameterized synthesis-helper unit tests + orchestrator-level integration tests + per-file file-Symbol no-duplication test cover the invariant; (#3) sketch top-30 contains zero kind=file Symbols, top-30 list preserved within +/-3 (TreeSitterAnalyzer / find_files / Symbol / Span / register_analyzer / ...). 739 first-party file Symbols enter the graph (kept in JSON for slice / containment / per-file metrics). Schema 0.2.3 -> 0.2.4 (additive: 'file' added to Symbol.kind enum). Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation; the cohort that confirms it should ALSO revisit WI-fozoh's '37% external_symbol drop' tag, since the denominator changes when these 739 Symbols stop counting as boundary externals."  # c2a4
